                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "I was about to say that you should not rely only on colour, **but** after thinking about this for a moment, I realized that you are right. Even if I had to use the `ascii` option, I can add the slash to the left. Thanks for your time.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I was about to say that you should not rely only on colour, <strong>but</strong> after thinking about this for a moment, I realized that you are right. Even if I had to use the <code class=\"notranslate\">ascii</code> option, I can add the slash to the left. Thanks for your time.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "I was about to say that you should not rely only on colour, but after thinking about this for a moment, I realized that you are right. Even if I had to use the ascii option, I can add the slash to the left. Thanks for your time.",
